  <regions type="content">
    <region left="18" top="9" width="714" height="40" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Industrial Cooling Tower Psychrometrics, Merkel Heat/Mass Transfer &amp; Water Makeup Model (Osmaniye, Turkey)</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="63" width="91" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="false">2026-10-20</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="99" width="749" height="149" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Industrial Induced-Draft Counterflow Cooling Tower Simulation</p>
    <p bold="true">Heat &amp; Mass Transfer, Exit Air Psychrometrics &amp; Makeup Water Optimization (Osmaniye, Turkey)</p>
    <p bold="true">Dual Plugins: IF97Wrapper.dll (IAPWS-IF97 Steam Tables) + PsychroLibWrapper.dll (ASHRAE 2017 Psychrometrics)</p>
    <p bold="true">Strict Physical Unit Guarantee: Pressures [Pa, bar], Temperatures [K, °C], Enthalpies [J/kg, kJ/kg], Flows [kg/s, m³/h]</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="252" width="764" height="568" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="false">This worksheet provides a rigorous thermohydraulic, psychrometric, and water-mass balance model for an</p>
    <p bold="false">industrial mechanical-draft counterflow cooling tower operating in Osmaniye, Turkey (elevation z = 125 m).</p>
    <p bold="false">The cooling tower rejects 10.45 MW of process heat from a chemical plant / power cycle loop, cooling 250 kg/s</p>
    <p bold="false">(900 m³/h) of circulating water from 42.0 °C to 32.0 °C across an ambient summer wet-bulb temperature of 25.83 °C.</p>
    <p bold="false"></p>
    <p bold="false">Key Engineering Highlights:</p>
    <p bold="false">  1. Dual Plugin Integration: High-accuracy thermodynamic properties of water and steam from IF97</p>
    <p bold="false">     (heat capacity cp, latent heat h_fg, saturation pressure Psat, liquid density) coupled with</p>
    <p bold="false">     ASHRAE 2017 moist air psychrometrics (barometric pressure, humidity ratio, wet-bulb, enthalpy).</p>
    <p bold="false">  2. Non-Linear Exit Air Solving: Formulation of tower energy balance and solution of saturated exit air</p>
    <p bold="false">     temperature (T_out = 34.33 °C) and humidity ratio (W_out = 35.73 g/kg) via plugin-free dimensional Secant solver.</p>
    <p bold="false">  3. Merkel Transfer Number (Me = KaV/L): Calculation of tower characteristic via Cooling Technology Institute</p>
    <p bold="false">     (CTI) 4-point Chebyshev numerical quadrature (Me_cheb = Me_int = 1.0107).</p>
    <p bold="false">  4. Dimensional Native RK4 Fill Depth Profiles: 13-statement Runge-Kutta 4th-order algorithm (Urroz paradigm)</p>
    <p bold="false">     formulated inside an AreaRegion with 100% authentic physical units, yielding axial temperature and enthalpy profiles.</p>
    <p bold="false">  5. Comprehensive Water Makeup &amp; Conservation: Parametric evaluation of evaporation loss, drift, blowdown,</p>
    <p bold="false">     and total makeup water consumption across Cycles of Concentration (CoC = 2 to 8).</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="846" width="707" height="71" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 1: Site Altimetry &amp; Osmaniye Ambient Psychrometrics</p>
    <p bold="true">Barometric reduction to site elevation (z = 125 m) and evaluation of summer design ambient moist air properties.</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="909" width="114" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Plant site elevation above mean sea level in Osmaniye, Turkey: z = 125 m</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">z_site</e>
          <e type="operand">125</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="972" width="372" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Site barometric atmospheric pressure: P_atm = 99 832 Pa (0.9983 bar)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
          <e type="operand">z_site</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">Psy_AtmPressure</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">99832.3333</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">Pa</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1044" width="187" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Osmaniye summer design dry-bulb temperature: T_db = 36.0 °C (309.15 K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">T_db_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">36</e>
          <e type="operand">273.15</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1107" width="110" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Summer design ambient relative humidity: RH = 45% (0.450)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">RH_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">0.45</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1170" width="504" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Ambient wet-bulb temperature: T_wb = 25.83 °C (298.98 K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">T_wb_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">T_db_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">RH_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">Psy_TWetBulb_RH</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">298.9778</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1233" width="452" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Ambient humidity ratio: W_amb = 0.01713 kg/kg dry air (17.13 g/kg)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">W_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">T_db_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">RH_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">Psy_HumRatio_RH</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">0.0171</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1296" width="446" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Inlet ambient moist air specific enthalpy: h_in = 80 206 J/kg dry air (80.21 kJ/kg)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">h_a_in</e>
          <e type="operand">T_db_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">W_amb</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">Psy_Enthalpy</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">J</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">80205.9398</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kg</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1377" width="486" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Inlet moist air density: rho_in = 1.114 kg/m³</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">rho_a_in</e>
          <e type="operand">T_db_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">W_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">Psy_AirDensity</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">1.1136</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kg</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
          <e type="operand">3</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1440" width="458" height="25" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Ambient dew-point temperature: T_dp = 22.19 °C (295.34 K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">T_dp_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">T_db_amb</e>
          <e type="operand">RH_amb</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">Psy_TDewPoint_RH</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">295.3426</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1503" width="733" height="55" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 2: Cooling Tower Circulation, Range, Approach &amp; Thermal Duty</p>
    <p bold="true">Water mass flow, cooling range, thermal approach, and duty evaluation using IAPWS-IF97 liquid properties.</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1575" width="102" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Circulating cooling water mass flow rate: m_w = 250 kg/s (900 m³/h)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">m_w</e>
          <e type="operand">250</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kg</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">s</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1638" width="171" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Hot water return temperature from process exchangers to tower top: T_w_in = 42.0 °C (315.15 K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">T_w_in</e>
          <e type="operand">42</e>
          <e type="operand">273.15</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1719" width="179" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Cold water supply temperature from basin to plant exchangers: T_w_out = 32.0 °C (305.15 K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">T_w_out</e>
          <e type="operand">32</e>
          <e type="operand">273.15</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1800" width="251" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Mean circulating water temperature: T_w_mean = 37.0 °C (310.15 K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">T_w_mean</e>
          <e type="operand">0.5</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_in</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_out</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1863" width="256" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Cooling range: Delta_T_range = 10.0 K (10.0 °C)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Delta_T_range</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_in</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_out</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1926" width="333" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Cooling approach to ambient wet-bulb: Delta_T_app = 6.17 K (6.17 °C approach)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Delta_T_app</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_out</e>
          <e type="operand">T_wb_amb</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">6.1722</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1989" width="419" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Isobaric heat capacity of liquid water from IF97 at 37 °C: cp_w = 4178.7 J/(kg*K)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">cp_w</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_mean</e>
          <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">IF97_cp_Tp</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">J</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">4178.7164</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kg</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="2070" width="395" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Latent heat of vaporization from IF97 at 37 °C: h_fg = 2 413 170 J/kg (2413.2 kJ/kg)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">h_fg_37C</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_mean</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">IF97_hfg_T</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">J</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">2.4132</e>
          <e type="operand">10</e>
          <e type="operand">6</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kg</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="2151" width="400" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Liquid water density from IF97 at 37 °C: rho_w = 993.3 kg/m³</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">rho_w</e>
          <e type="operand">T_w_mean</e>
          <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
          <e type="function" args="2">IF97_rho_Tp</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">993.3354</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">kg</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
          <e type="operand">3</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="2214" width="373" height="33" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Total thermal cooling duty: Q_duty = 10 446 791 W (10.447 MW)</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Q_duty</e>
          <e type="operand">m_w</e>
          <e type="operand">cp_w</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">Delta_T_range</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">1.0447</e>
          <e type="operand">10</e>
          <e type="operand">7</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">W</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="2277" width="748" height="55" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 3: Air Mass Flow Rate, Exit Enthalpy &amp; Saturated Exit Air State</p>
    <p bold="true">Tower overall energy balance, exit moist air enthalpy, and non-linear exit temperature solving via FindRoot().</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="2340" width="126" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math decimalPlaces="4">
        <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
          <content>
        <p>Liquid-to-Gas mass flow ratio (L/G = m_w / m_a): LG_ratio = 1.10</p>
      </content>
        </description>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">LG_ratio</e>
          <e type="operand">1.10</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
