    <region left="18" top="5733" width="759" height="55" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 6: Dimensional Native Runge-Kutta 4th-Order (RK4) Fill Depth Profile</p>
    <p bold="true">Handwritten 13-statement Urroz algorithm inside an AreaRegion integrating counterflow fill depth z in [0, 2 m].</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region top="5823" color="#000000">
      <area collapsed="false" />
      <region left="18" top="5859" width="751" height="211" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
          <content>
      <p bold="false">■ Counterflow Differential Equations Along Fill Height z ∈ [0, Z_fill]:</p>
      <p bold="false">  • Bottom of fill (z = 0 m): Fresh ambient air enters (h_a = h_in) and cooled water exits (T_w = T_out).</p>
      <p bold="false">  • Top of fill (z = Z_fill = 2 m): Hot water enters (T_w = T_in) and warm exhaust air exits (h_a = h_out).</p>
      <p bold="false">  • By cooling tower energy balance, air enthalpy tracks the operating line: h_a(Tw) = h_in + (L/G)·cp_w·(Tw - T_out).</p>
      <p bold="false">  • Differential water temperature: dTw/dz = (Me / Z_fill) · [h_sat(Tw) - h_a(Tw)] / cp_w in [K/m].</p>
      <p bold="false">  Integrated via classical 13-statement Urroz Runge-Kutta 4th-order algorithm with 100% authentic physical units.</p>
      </content>
        </text>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6048" width="114" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Total cellular PVC fill pack depth: Z_fill = 2.0 m</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">Z_fill</e>
            <e type="operand">2.0</e>
            <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6111" width="94" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Number of axial integration increments: N_fill = 20</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">N_fill</e>
            <e type="operand">20</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6183" width="240" height="42" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Fill step increment: dz = 0.1 m</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">dz_fill</e>
            <e type="operand">Z_fill</e>
            <e type="operand">N_fill</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
            <e type="function" args="1">eval</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
          <result action="numeric">
            <e type="operand">0.1</e>
            <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          </result>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6246" width="547" height="121" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Differential water temperature gradient rate_tw(z, Tw) in [K/m]</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">z_coord</e>
            <e type="operand">Tw_val</e>
            <e type="function" args="2">rate_tw</e>
            <e type="operand">w_sat</e>
            <e type="operand">Tw_val</e>
            <e type="operand">1</e>
            <e type="operand">P_atm</e>
            <e type="function" args="3">Psy_HumRatio_RH</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
            <e type="operand">h_sat</e>
            <e type="operand">Tw_val</e>
            <e type="operand">w_sat</e>
            <e type="function" args="2">Psy_Enthalpy</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
            <e type="operand">driving</e>
            <e type="operand">h_sat</e>
            <e type="operand">Tw_val</e>
            <e type="function" args="1">h_air_op</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
            <e type="function" args="1">eval</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
            <e type="operand">Me_cheb</e>
            <e type="operand">Z_fill</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
            <e type="operand">driving</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
            <e type="operand">cp_w</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
            <e type="function" args="1">eval</e>
            <e type="operand">4</e>
            <e type="operand">1</e>
            <e type="function" args="6">line</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6471" width="331" height="27" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Axial position grid z_grid spanning [0, 2.0] m (21 points)</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">z_grid</e>
            <e type="operand">0</e>
            <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
            <e type="operand">Z_fill</e>
            <e type="operand">0</e>
            <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
            <e type="operand">dz_fill</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
            <e type="function" args="3">range</e>
            <e type="function" args="1">eval</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6543" width="151" height="27" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Initial water temperature matrix at z = 0 m: tw_sol = [T_w_out [K]] (1x1)</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">tw_sol</e>
            <e type="operand">T_w_out</e>
            <e type="operand">1</e>
            <e type="operand">1</e>
            <e type="function" args="3">mat</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6606" width="70" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>RK4 loop counter register</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">k_rk</e>
            <e type="operand">1</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          </input>
        </math>
      </region>
      <region left="18" top="6669" width="98" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
        <math decimalPlaces="4">
          <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
            <content>
          <p>Butcher tableau sub-step depth register z0 [m]</p>
        </content>
          </description>
          <input>
            <e type="operand">z0_reg</e>
            <e type="operand">0</e>
            <e type="operand" style="unit">m</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
            <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
